<%- include('partials/header',{title:'Published polls'}) %><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">PUBLIC OPINION · POLL REGISTER</span><h1>Read the polls.<br><em>Check the methodology.</em></h1><p>Each poll is a snapshot of responses at a particular time—not a prediction of the final election result.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="notice"><strong>How to read this page:</strong> Consider fieldwork dates, question wording, sample design, interview mode, weighting, and who commissioned or funded each survey.</div><% polls.forEach(p=>{ %><article class="poll-card mb-4"><div class="poll-heading"><div><span class="date-label">Published <%= p.published %></span><h2><%= p.pollster %></h2><p><%= p.question %></p></div><span class="tag">Published poll snapshot</span></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-7"><% p.results.forEach(r=>{ %><div class="poll-result"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><span><%= r[0] %></span><strong><%= r[1] %>%</strong></div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:<%= Math.min(100,r[1]) %>%"></div></div></div><% }) %><div class="poll-result undecided"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><span>Undecided / as reported</span><strong><%= p.undecided %>%</strong></div><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill muted" style="width:<%= Math.min(100,p.undecided) %>%"></div></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="poll-meta"><div><span>Fieldwork</span><strong><%= p.fieldwork %></strong></div><div><span>Sample</span><strong><%= p.sample %></strong></div><div><span>Method</span><strong><%= p.method %></strong></div><div><span>Reported margin of error</span><strong><%= p.margin %></strong></div></div></div></div><p class="fine-print">Source checked: <%= p.checkedAt %>. <%= p.verification %> Published figures are updated manually.</p><div class="caveat"><strong>Limitations:</strong> <%= p.caveat %></div><a class="text-link" href="<%= p.source %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source report / coverage ↗</a></article><% }) %><p class="fine-print">Figures are transcribed from linked reporting and should be checked against original releases. Percentages may not sum to 100% because of rounding or omitted categories.</p></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
